      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Brexucabtagene autoleucel after at least two systemic\nlines including a BTKi.\nEngland route remains Cancer Drugs Fund managed access\nwith live national and panel criteria.\nDo not describe as unrestricted baseline commissioning.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
